Carbon dioxide pipelines-eminent domain
HB0244
prohibition.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Winter, Allemand, Angelos, Strock
and Wharff and Senator(s) Steinmetz
AN ACT relating to eminent domain; prohibiting persons from using the power of
eminent domain to place pipelines conveying carbon dioxide for the purposes of
carbon capture, utilization or storage; specifying applicability; making
conforming amendments; and providing for an effective date.
